 *   Raindrop module digital out -> GPIO17 (BCM)
 *   Raindrop module VCC         -> 3.3 V (Pin 1)
 *   Raindrop module GND         -> GND  (Pin 6)
 *
 * The Raindrop module digital output is active-low:
 *   LOW  (0) -> Rain detected
 *   HIGH (1) -> No rain
