/*
 * Autonomous line-following robot for Raspberry Pi 5.
 * Sensor : SunFounder 3-Way Tracking Sensor (IR reflectance, digital)
 * Wiring :
 *   Left   sensor -> GPIO4  (BCM)
 *   Center sensor -> GPIO17 (BCM)
 *   Right  sensor -> GPIO27 (BCM)
